EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Even though I have not yet heard back from you, I was able to keep your account with our customer service team to try and work something out and avoid litigation.  Please contact me as soon as you can so I can see what I can do for you based on your current financial circumstances.

I look forward to hearing from you.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
